# Flex oci-p-flex_1 iptables rules
# Pulled: 2026-02-07
# Custom INPUT chain (strict):
#   ACCEPT: established, ICMP, loopback, SSH (22), WireGuard subnet (10.0.0.0/24)
#   ACCEPT: 35.226.147.64 (GCP) → port 8443 (code-server)
#   REJECT: everything else
#
# Docker networks:
# br-a14fa7ea677e = dev_network (main)
# br-ad3813305235 = nocodb_network
# br-e358b303d5a7 = gitea_backup_network
# br-060ac89c931b = sauron_security

# Custom filter rules:
*filter
-A INPUT -m state --state RELATED,ESTABLISHED -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -p icmp -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -i lo -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -p tcp -m state --state NEW -m tcp --dport 22 -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -s 10.0.0.0/24 -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -s 35.226.147.64/32 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 8443 -j ACCEPT
-A INPUT -j REJECT --reject-with icmp-host-prohibited
